Wojciech is a high-ranking member of the [[Org/Althane/Golden Sparrows|Golden Sparrows]] and carries their word in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Sarengrad|Sarengrad]]. He is an old gnome, three feet tall and mottled, the color almost gone from him: white hair, black eyes ringed with pale spell lines that have lost their color. He wears a puffy jacket and keeps a messenger bag at his side.

Both [[People/Althane/Henrik|Henrik]] and [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]] reported to him in their time with the movement. He keeps the Sparrows' safe houses and their mobile clinics, and it was he who brought the party the dossier an enemy had made of their abilities, and who arranged their meeting with [[People/Althane/Masha|Masha]]. He gave the party six quicksilver shield spikes, stolen from a Fourth House camp, and asked them not to run to their deaths.
